<body>
<h1>Persian Calendar for Issabel</h1>
<p>The Persian Calendar module adds comprehensive Solar Hijri (Shamsi / Jalali) support to Issabel PBX.</p>

<h2>Features:</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Shamsi DatePicker:</strong> An interactive, responsive Persian datepicker in all date input fields (CDR reports, recordings, logs, etc.).</li>
  <li><strong>Table & Grid Conversion:</strong> Transparently translates Gregorian timestamps in tables to Persian dates, with tooltips showing original Gregorian values on mouse hover.</li>
  <li><strong>Live System Clock:</strong> Displays a real-time Shamsi date and clock in the top header bar.</li>
  <li><strong>Transparent Backend Translation:</strong> Translates Jalali date filter requests into Gregorian dates before database queries, ensuring Asterisk CDR queries succeed without any database schema modification.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Settings:</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Digits:</strong> Choose between Persian numerals (۱۲۳) or Latin numerals (123).</li>
  <li><strong>Date Format:</strong> Choose between YYYY/MM/DD or YYYY-MM-DD format.</li>
</ul>

